# ROS Build Directory

When building ROS 2 packages (colcon build), always run from the workspace root:

```
/home/hunter/kanga
```

**Correct:**
```bash
cd /home/hunter/kanga && colcon build --packages-select <package_name>
```

**Wrong:** Do not run colcon from `/home/hunter/kanga/src` — that is the packages directory, not the workspace root.
